# P92 on WSL GtkBackend, run with SCUI_P92_MENU=1 (pass it as TEST_APP_ENV, the only variables the WSL launcher forwards): the steps of actions/win/P92-edit-menu-gtk4.actions -- Select All, Copy, Paste, Undo, Redo through the Edit menu, then the app's own AFTER-undoRedo item.
# Positions from AT-SPI under WSLg (x11) with the menu open, 2026-10-21, client coordinates: Edit (93,13); the menu spans x 63-221, y 20-364, and its items -- unnamed in AT-SPI, in the order Windows GTK shows -- sit at x 136: Undo 37, Redo 67, AFTER-undoRedo 97, Cut 140, Copy 170, Paste 200, Delete 230, Select All 260. Field (308,166), its text end (420,166).
# Expected in p92-commands.log: field hellohello (Paste), field hello (Undo), field hellohello (Redo), command AFTER-undoRedo.
# P92(WSL,SCUI_P92_MENU=1):經 Edit 選單全選、複製、貼上，再復原、重做，最後點 app 自己的項目。預期結果見上方英文。
